          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**SEC1** (`BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY`) — bare ukryptert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Set forwarding** — a **local port** on your Mac, plus the **remote host and port** the tunnel should reach via the SSH server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Set forwarding** — a **local port** on your Mac, plus the **remote host and port** the tunnel should reach via the SSH server."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "**Définir la redirection** — un **port local** sur votre Mac, ainsi que l’**hôte et le port distants** que le tunnel doit atteindre via le serveur SSH."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Angi videresending** — en **lokal port** på Macen, samt **ekstern vert og port** som tunnelen skal nå via SSH-serveren."
          }
