    "How long a single authentication is remembered. Within this window, reconnecting won't ask again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How long a single authentication is remembered. Within this window, reconnecting won't ask again."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Durée pendant laquelle une authentification unique reste mémorisée. Pendant cette période, une reconnexion ne la redemandera pas."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvor lenge én enkelt autentisering huskes. Innenfor dette tidsvinduet blir du ikke spurt igjen når du kobler til på nytt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud sync" : {
      "comment" : "A description of how connections sync between devices.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud sync"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Synchronisation iCloud"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud-synkronisering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your key is encrypted, you'll be prompted for the passphrase each time you connect. **Passphrases are never saved** — they live only in memory during a connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your key is encrypted, you'll be prompted for the passphrase each time you connect. **Passphrases are never saved** — they live only in memory during a connect."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Si votre clé est chiffrée, la phrase secrète vous sera demandée à chaque fois que vous vous connectez. **Les phrases secrètes ne sont jamais enregistrées** — elles n’existent en mémoire que le temps de la connexion."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis nøkkelen er kryptert, blir du bedt om passfrasen hver gang du kobler til. **Passfraser lagres aldri** — de finnes bare i minnet mens du kobler til."
          }
